      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "A graded categorical read of crew service is a strong axis for identifying advantage attributes tied to high ratings. Samples map soundly ('outstanding', 'consistently good', 'very nice and helpful' -> exceptional/good). Slightly generous readings but well grounded."
